{"ID":"20240504164241-p2svh9y","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240504164241-p2svh9y","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240504164241-p2svh9y\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240621115221-nseca5u\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240611094709-vrhg9js\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:900,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240621115120-gicjfkw\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:3,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:3\u0026#125;","title":"130鲤鱼胆","type":"doc","updated":"20240811170533"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240621115221-nseca5u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240621115221-nseca5u","updated":"20240621115449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240621115221-y9ohhjx.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 318px;","style":"width: 308px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240621115449-4uk7g4m.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 308px;\" parent-style=\"width: 318px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"}]},{"ID":"20240621115120-gicjfkw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240621115120-gicjfkw","updated":"20240621115120"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240621114946-1ruivgg.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240621115120-zqrja7s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240621115120-zqrja7s","updated":"20240811170514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 650px;","style":"width: 640px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"鲤鱼"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/鲤鱼-20240621114723-3rqfxbm.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 640px;\" parent-style=\"width: 650px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240811170533-y5ldha0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240811170533-y5ldha0","updated":"20240811170533"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 653px;","style":"width: 643px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"鲤鱼"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/鲤鱼-20240811170248-wxv9bt7.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 643px;\" parent-style=\"width: 653px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240811170533-nsiiwbj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240811170533-nsiiwbj","updated":"20240811170533"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 655px;","style":"width: 645px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"鲤鱼 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/鲤鱼 1-20240811170339-6d3fgt6.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 645px;\" parent-style=\"width: 655px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240611094840-wbbjo2j","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611094840-wbbjo2j"}},{"ID":"20240611094854-h3fchrm","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611094854-h3fchrm","updated":"20240611094900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鲤鱼胆《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240611094854-mwokf1l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094854-mwokf1l","updated":"20240611094854"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240611094854-zfhtc7d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094854-zfhtc7d","updated":"20240611094854"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主目热赤痛青盲，明目。久服，强悍益志气。生池泽。"}]},{"ID":"20240611094854-ucjgo9n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094854-ucjgo9n","updated":"20240611094854"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《名医》曰：生九江，采无时。"}]},{"ID":"20240611094854-rkjgcba","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094854-rkjgcba","updated":"20240611094854"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"案《说文》云：鲤，鳣也。鳣，鲤也。《尔雅》云：鲤鳣.舍人云：鲤，一名鳣.郭璞注鲤云：今赤鲤鱼。注鳣云：大鱼似鲟。《毛诗》云：鳣鲔发发。《传》云：鳣，鲤也，据此知郭璞别为二，非矣。古今注云：兖州人呼赤鲤为赤骥，谓青鲤为青马，黑鲤为元驹，白鲤为白骐，黄鲤为黄雉。"}]},{"ID":"20240611094854-wsel1y2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094854-wsel1y2","updated":"20240611094907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"上虫，鱼。上品一十种，旧同。"}]},{"ID":"20240611094918-zaf7n8a","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611094918-zaf7n8a"}},{"ID":"20240611094919-32nui5t","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611094919-32nui5t","updated":"20240611094925"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鲤鱼胆《千金翼方》"}]},{"ID":"20240611094919-wx7zuhd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094919-wx7zuhd","updated":"20240611094919"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，寒，有毒。主目热赤痛，青盲明目，久服强悍，益志气。"}]},{"ID":"20240611094919-t74hq9z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094919-t74hq9z","updated":"20240611094919"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"鲤鱼肉"}]},{"ID":"20240611094919-i94k8ob","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094919-i94k8ob","updated":"20240611094919"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘，主咳逆上气，黄胆，止渴，生者主水肿，脚满，下气。"}]},{"ID":"20240611094919-kn9b6gg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094919-kn9b6gg","updated":"20240611094919"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"鲤鱼骨"}]},{"ID":"20240611094919-1tdvxbm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094919-1tdvxbm","updated":"20240611094919"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主女子带下赤白。"}]},{"ID":"20240611094919-1rlc925","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094919-1rlc925","updated":"20240611094919"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"鲤鱼齿"}]},{"ID":"20240611094919-t7i4zqb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094919-t7i4zqb","updated":"20240611094919"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主石淋。生九江池泽，取无时。"}]},{"ID":"20240611094929-no4ziil","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611094929-no4ziil"}},{"ID":"20240611094931-refs1x1","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611094931-refs1x1","updated":"20240611094935"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鲤鱼胆《本草易读》"}]},{"ID":"20240611094931-11bkrv2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094931-11bkrv2","updated":"20240611094931"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘。喉痹将死，点入即活。"}]},{"ID":"20240611094907-9d75uai","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611094907-9d75uai"}},{"ID":"20240611094909-xnmkltp","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611094909-xnmkltp","updated":"20240611094913"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鲤鱼胆《名医别录》"}]},{"ID":"20240611094909-tesb7mn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094909-tesb7mn","updated":"20240611094909"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"无毒．肉，味甘，治咳逆上气，黄胆，止渴．生者，治水肿脚满，下气．骨，治女下赤白．齿，治石淋．生九江取无时．"}]},{"ID":"20240611094909-jhg3qz8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094909-jhg3qz8","updated":"20240611094909"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》原文∶鲤鱼胆，味苦，寒．主目热赤痛，青盲，明目．久服，强悍益志气．生池泽．"}]},{"ID":"20240611094840-cdymtrx","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611094840-cdymtrx"}},{"ID":"20240611094841-qyj8xht","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611094841-qyj8xht","updated":"20240611094850"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鲤鱼胆《本草经集注》"}]},{"ID":"20240611094841-uovsp46","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094841-uovsp46","updated":"20240611094841"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，寒，无毒。主治目热赤痛，青盲，明目。久服强悍，益志气。肉∶味甘，主咳逆上气，黄胆，止渴。生者，主治水肿脚满，下气。骨∶主女子带下赤白。齿∶主石淋。生九江池泽，取无时。"}]},{"ID":"20240611094841-ru0stkr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094841-ru0stkr","updated":"20240614173030"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鲤鱼，最为鱼之主，形既可爱，又能神变，乃至飞越山湖，所以琴高乘之。"}]},{"ID":"20240611094819-8frir50","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611094819-8frir50"}},{"ID":"20240611094820-5f0wqa5","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611094820-5f0wqa5","updated":"20240611094828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鲤鱼胆《神农本草经赞》"}]},{"ID":"20240611094820-9xnkevo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094820-9xnkevo","updated":"20240611094831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦寒。主目热赤痛。青盲明目。久服强悍。益志气。生池泽。 三十六鳞。披胆加志。弗共冰栖。非调饴味。熊可和丸。獭亦分器。苦口功同。悬珠目 治。 苏颂曰。胁鳞一道无大小。皆三十六鳞。汉书传。路温舒披大胆。新书俯而加志。晋 书纪 。武帝衔胆栖冰。李歌。尝胆不苦味若饴。唐书传。柳仲郢母。和熊胆丸使夜咀咽。说文 。獭胆分卮。史记世家。毒药苦口利于病。汉书传。东方朔目若悬珠。谷梁传。六先数聚 辞也。目治也。李时珍曰。熊胆明目去翳。苏颂曰。獭胆主治目翳。视物不明。"}]},{"ID":"20240611094706-ab5gs3q","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611094706-ab5gs3q"}},{"ID":"20240611094801-qw8akg0","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611094801-qw8akg0","updated":"20240611094809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鲤鱼胆《新修本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240611094801-8qcxwkl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094801-8qcxwkl","updated":"20240611094801"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，寒，无毒。主目热赤痛，青盲，明目。久服强悍，益志气。肉，味甘，主咳逆上气，黄胆，止渴；生者，主水肿脚满，下气。骨，主女子带下赤白。齿，主石淋。生九江池泽，取无时。"}]},{"ID":"20240611094801-x0sqrm1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094801-x0sqrm1","updated":"20240611094801"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鲤鱼，最为鱼之主，形既可爱，又能神变，乃至飞越山湖，所以琴高乘之。山上水中有鲤不可食。又鲤 不可合小豆藿食之。其子合猪肝食之，亦能害人尔。"}]},{"ID":"20240611094801-13sg430","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094801-13sg430","updated":"20240611094801"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔谨案〕鲤鱼骨，主阴蚀，鲠不出。血，主小儿丹肿及疮。皮，主瘾疹。脑，主诸痫。肠，主小儿肌疮。"}]},{"ID":"20240611094953-forggva","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611094953-forggva"}},{"ID":"20240611094955-u7huc7u","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611094955-u7huc7u","updated":"20240611095006"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鲤鱼胆《证类本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240611094955-zeuec8b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094955-zeuec8b","updated":"20240611094955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，寒，无毒。主目热赤痛，青盲，明目。久服强悍，益志气。"}]},{"ID":"20240611094955-abnlcpf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094955-abnlcpf","updated":"20240611094955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"肉"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘，主咳逆上气，黄胆，止渴。生者，主水肿脚满，下气。"}]},{"ID":"20240611094955-l68lrby","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094955-l68lrby","updated":"20240611094955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"臣禹锡等谨按大腹水肿通用药云∶鲤鱼，寒。药对云∶平。陈士良云∶无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240611094955-qajye1p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094955-qajye1p","updated":"20240611094955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"骨"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主女子带下赤白。"}]},{"ID":"20240611094955-5x8ndvm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094955-5x8ndvm","updated":"20240611094955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"齿"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主石淋。生九江池泽。取无时。"}]},{"ID":"20240611094955-3xywf1t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094955-3xywf1t","updated":"20240611094955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陶隐居云∶鲤鱼，最为鱼之主，形既可爱，又能神变，乃至飞越山湖，所以琴高乘之。"}]},{"ID":"20240611094955-ussoxsb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094955-ussoxsb","updated":"20240611094955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"山上水中有鲤不可食。又鲤 不可合小豆藿食之。其子合猪肝食之，亦能害人尔。唐本注云∶鲤鱼骨，主阴蚀，哽不出。血，主小儿丹肿及疮。皮，主瘾疹，脑，主诸痫。"}]},{"ID":"20240611094955-1xnyeg2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094955-1xnyeg2","updated":"20240611094955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肠，主小儿肌疮。今按陈藏器本草云∶鲤鱼肉，主安胎，胎动，怀妊身肿。煮为汤食之，破冷气 癖，气块横关伏梁，作脍以浓蒜齑食之。胆，主耳聋，滴耳中，目为灰，研敷刺疮，中风水疼肿，汁出即愈。诸鱼目并得。臣禹锡等谨按药性论云∶鲤鱼胆亦可单用，味大苦。点眼治赤肿翳痛。小儿热肿涂之。蜀漆为使。鱼烧灰末，治咳嗽，糯米煮粥。孟诜云∶鲤鱼白煮食之，疗水肿脚满，下气，腹有宿瘕不可食。又修理，可去脊上两筋及黑血，毒故也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611094955-2agsrcz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094955-2agsrcz","updated":"20240611094955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"又天行病后不可食，再发即死。其在沙石中者，毒多在脑中，不得食头。日华子云∶鲤鱼，凉，有毒。肉治咳嗽，疗香港脚，破冷气， 癖。怀孕人胎不安，用绢裹鳞和鱼煮羹，熟后去鳞，食之验。脂治小儿痫疾惊忤。胆治障翳等。脑髓治暴聋，煮粥服良。诸溪涧中者，头内有毒。不计大小，并三十六鳞也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611094955-wk5bqxp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094955-wk5bqxp","updated":"20240611094955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"图经曰∶鲤鱼，生九江池泽，今处处有之。即赤鲤鱼也。其脊中鳞一道，每鳞上皆有小黑点，从头数至尾，无大小皆三十六鳞。古语云∶五尺之鲤与一寸之鲤，大小虽殊，而鳞之数等是也。又，崔豹《古今注》释鲤鱼有三种。兖州人谓赤鲤为玄驹，谓白鲤为白骥，黄鲤为黄雉。盖诸鱼中，此为最佳，又能神变，故多贵之。今人食品中以为上味。其胆、肉、骨、齿皆入药。古今方∶书并用之。胡洽治中风脚弱，短气腹满，有鲤鱼汤方∶最胜。脂、血、目睛、脑髓亦单使治疾，唯子不可与肝同食。又齿主石淋。《古今录验》着其方∶云∶鲤鱼齿一升筛末，以三岁苦酒和，分三服。宿不食，旦服一分，日中服一分，暮服一分，瘥。赤鲤鱼鳞亦入药。唐方∶多用治产妇腹痛，烧灰酒调服之。兼治血气，杂诸药用之。"}]},{"ID":"20240611094955-uqrc6qt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094955-uqrc6qt","updated":"20240611094955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陈藏器云∶鲤鱼，从脊当中数至尾，无大小皆有三十六鳞，亦其成数也。食疗胆，主除目中赤及热毒痛，点之良。肉，白煮食之，疗水肿脚满，下气。腹中有宿瘕不可食，害人。久服天门冬人，亦不可食。刺在肉中，中风水肿痛者，烧鲤鱼眼睛作灰，纳疮中，汁出即可。谨按鱼血，主小儿丹毒，涂之即瘥。鱼鳞，烧，烟绝，研，酒下方寸匕，破产妇滞血。脂，主诸痫，食之良。肠，主小儿腹中疮。鲤鱼 ，不得和豆藿叶食之，成瘦。其鱼子，不得合猪肝食之。凡修理，可去脊上两筋及黑血，毒故也。炙鲤鱼切忌烟，不得令熏着眼，损人眼光。三、两日内必见验也。又天行病后不可食，再发即死。其在砂石中者，有毒，多在脑中，不得食头。圣惠方∶治水气，利小便，除浮肿。用鲤鱼一头，重一斤者，治如食法修事，食之。外台秘要∶《古今录验》∶疗鱼鲠骨横喉中，六、七日不出。取鲤鱼鳞、皮合烧作屑，以水服之，则出，未出更服。又方∶疗水病肿。鲤鱼一头极大者，去头尾及骨，唯取肉，以水二斗，赤小豆一大升，和鱼肉煮，可取二升以上汁，生布绞去滓，顿服尽，如不能尽，分为二服，后服温令暖，服讫当下利，利尽即瘥。又方∶疗 。鲤鱼肠切作五段，火上炙之，洗疮拭干，以肠封之，冷则易，自暮至旦，干止觉痒，开看虫出，瘥。又方∶凡肿已溃、未溃者。"}]},{"ID":"20240611094955-jytoqzk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094955-jytoqzk","updated":"20240611094955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"烧鲤鱼作灰，酢和涂之一切肿上，以瘥为度。又方∶疗卒淋。鲤鱼齿烧灰，酒服方寸匕。千金方∶治暴痢。小鲤鱼一枚，烧为末，米饮服之。大人、小儿俱服得。又方∶小儿咽肿喉痹。"}]},{"ID":"20240611094955-4inofni","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094955-4inofni","updated":"20240611094955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以鲤鱼胆二七枚，和灶底土，以涂咽喉，立瘥。肘后方∶疗雀目。鲤鱼胆及脑敷之，燥痛即明。食医心镜∶主上气咳嗽，胸膈妨满，气喘。鲤鱼一头切作脍，以姜、醋食之，蒜齑亦得。又方∶主肺咳嗽，气喘促。鲤鱼一头重四两，去鳞，纸裹火炮，去刺研，煮粥，空腹吃之。子母秘录∶疗妊娠伤寒。鲤鱼一头烧末，酒服方寸匕，令汗出。兼治乳无汁。产书下乳汁。烧鲤鱼一头研为末，酒调下一钱匕。礼记食鱼去乙，鱼目旁有骨名乙，如象乙字，食之令人鲠。"}]},{"ID":"20240611094955-017wayv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094955-017wayv","updated":"20240611094955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"衍义曰∶鲤鱼，至阴之物也，其鳞故三十六。阴极则阳复，所以《素问》曰∶鱼热中。"}]},{"ID":"20240611094955-rmrxzcf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094955-rmrxzcf","updated":"20240611094955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"王叔和曰∶热即生风，食之所以多发风热，诸家所解并不言。日华子云∶鲤鱼，凉，今不取，直取《素问》为正。万一风家更使食鱼，则是贻祸无穷矣。"}]},{"ID":"20240614173045-nwcglq4","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614173045-nwcglq4"}},{"ID":"20240614173046-vut0tgw","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614173046-vut0tgw","updated":"20240614173054"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鲤鱼《本草纲目》"}]},{"ID":"20240614173046-7qdxrwn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614173046-7qdxrwn","updated":"20240614173046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「气味」肉：甘、平、无毒。胆：苦、寒、无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240614173046-cyikpr6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614173046-cyikpr6","updated":"20240614173046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「主治」"}]},{"ID":"20240614173046-v5sevu7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614173046-v5sevu7","updated":"20240614173046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肉："}]},{"ID":"20240614173046-jdb3oa2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614173046-jdb3oa2","updated":"20240614173046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、水肿。用大鲤鱼一尾，加醋三升煮干吃下。一天吃一次。又方：用大鲤鱼一尾，赤小豆一升，加水二斗煮汁，一次，服完，下泻即愈。"}]},{"ID":"20240614173046-872y29r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614173046-872y29r","updated":"20240614173046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、妊娠水肿。治方同上。"}]},{"ID":"20240614173046-38oj6ye","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614173046-38oj6ye","updated":"20240614173046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、胎动不安。用鲤鱼一尾（治净），阿胶（炒）一两，糯米二合，水二升，加葱姜、桔皮、盐各少许，煮汤喝下三、五天见效。"}]},{"ID":"20240614173046-wnvobqo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614173046-wnvobqo","updated":"20240614173046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、乳汁不通。用鲤针一尾，烧为末，每服一钱，酒调下。"}]},{"ID":"20240614173046-hogbnyu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614173046-hogbnyu","updated":"20240614173046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、咳嗽气喘。用鲤鱼一尾，去鳞，纸裹炮熟，去刺研末，同糯米煮粥，空心服下。"}]},{"ID":"20240614173046-ka9w3mq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614173046-ka9w3mq","updated":"20240614173046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6、一切肿毒（无论已溃未溃）。用鲤鱼烧灰。调醋涂搽，直至病愈。"}]},{"ID":"20240614173046-hcw3mgo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614173046-hcw3mgo","updated":"20240614173046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"胆："}]},{"ID":"20240614173046-ehlwpne","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614173046-ehlwpne","updated":"20240614173046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、小儿咽肿、痹痛。用鲤鱼胆二十个，和灶底土调匀涂咽外，立效。"}]},{"ID":"20240614173046-sp9778y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614173046-sp9778y","updated":"20240614173046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、睛上生晕。用体长一尺二寸鲤鱼的胆，滴汁在铜器上，阴干后，竹刀刮下。每取少许点眼。"}]},{"ID":"20240614173046-0u7gfgs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614173046-0u7gfgs","updated":"20240614173046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、赤眼肿痛。用鲁鱼胆十个、腻粉一钱，和匀，收存瓶中，每日点眼。又方：用鲤鱼胆五个、黄连末半两，和匀，加蜂蜜少许，收存瓶中，放在饭上蒸熟。每天取药涂眼五、七次"}]},{"ID":"20240614173046-0qj3wmf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614173046-0qj3wmf","updated":"20240614173046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、大人阴痿。和鲤鱼胆雄鸡肝各一个，共研为末，加鱼卵和成丸子，如小豆大。每服一丸。"}]},{"ID":"20240614173046-d0vpdpe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614173046-d0vpdpe","updated":"20240614173046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、于盲。用鲤鱼胆。鲤钱脑等分，随时点胆。"}]},{"ID":"20240611094706-fpwrxze","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611094706-fpwrxze"}},{"ID":"20240611094707-qufrse6","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611094707-qufrse6","updated":"20240611094707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》：鲤鱼胆"}]},{"ID":"20240611094707-n388ef4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094707-n388ef4","updated":"20240611094707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240611094707-9nl4nfv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094707-9nl4nfv","updated":"20240611094707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Lǐ Yú Dǎn"}]},{"ID":"20240611094707-dbfas14","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094707-dbfas14","updated":"20240611094707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240611094707-55v1t8p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094707-55v1t8p","updated":"20240611094707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本经》"}]},{"ID":"20240611094707-gq7v29f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094707-gq7v29f","updated":"20240611094707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240611094707-o7lwlqk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094707-o7lwlqk","updated":"20240611094707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为鲤科动物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"鲤鱼"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"胆"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240611094707-5qakalq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094707-5qakalq","updated":"20240611094707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240611094707-wqyk7w3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094707-wqyk7w3","updated":"20240611094707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 除胆汁一般常有的胆汁酸、胆汁色素、脂类等外，尚含鲤甾醇；又证明在鲤体中，胆甾醇可变为鲤甾醇。还含别鹅脱氧胆酸。"}]},{"ID":"20240611094707-f2i7mgd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094707-f2i7mgd","updated":"20240611094707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240611094707-oyyo9lo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094707-oyyo9lo","updated":"20240611094707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①《本草经疏》：\"走厥阴。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611094707-z5kfvk1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094707-z5kfvk1","updated":"20240611094707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草求真》：\"入心、脾。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611094707-12lugtn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094707-12lugtn","updated":"20240611094707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240611094707-7v4jm0r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094707-7v4jm0r","updated":"20240611094707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①《本经》：\"味苦，寒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611094707-7stbfyz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094707-7stbfyz","updated":"20240611094707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611094707-niou74n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094707-niou74n","updated":"20240611094707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240611094707-bw744zc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094707-bw744zc","updated":"20240611094707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《药性论》：\"蜀漆为使。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611094707-uxiiei2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094707-uxiiei2","updated":"20240611094707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240611094707-2fud8u2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094707-2fud8u2","updated":"20240611094707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 清热明目，散翳消肿。治目赤肿痛，青盲障翳，咽痛喉痹。"}]},{"ID":"20240611094707-76xrpw5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094707-76xrpw5","updated":"20240611094707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"主目热赤痛，青盲，明目。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611094707-onmqmso","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094707-onmqmso","updated":"20240611094707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《肘后方》：\"点雀目燥痛。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611094707-56s7kll","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094707-56s7kll","updated":"20240611094707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《药性论》：\"点眼，治赤肿翳痛；小儿热肿涂之。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611094707-k54wcmn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094707-k54wcmn","updated":"20240611094707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《本草拾遗》：\"主耳聋，滴耳中。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611094707-14xfnok","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094707-14xfnok","updated":"20240611094707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《陆川本草》：\"清肝，明目，治白喉。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611094707-034gk3e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094707-034gk3e","updated":"20240611094707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240611094707-vbospjh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094707-vbospjh","updated":"20240611094707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：和药作丸。外用：取汁点涂。"}]},{"ID":"20240611094707-w1dcy59","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094707-w1dcy59","updated":"20240611094707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240611094707-rlzv738","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094707-rlzv738","updated":"20240611094707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治眼飞血赤脉及痛：鲤鱼胆五枚，黄连（去须，捣为末）半两。上二味，取胆汁调黄连末，纳瓷合盛，于饭上蒸一次，取出，如干，即入少许蜜，调似膏。日五、七度，涂敷目眦。（《圣济总录》鱼胆敷眼膏）"}]},{"ID":"20240611094707-4t9upmk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094707-4t9upmk","updated":"20240611094707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治眼睛上生晕，不问久新：鲤鱼一头，长一尺二寸者，取胆用，刺破，滴汁在铜照上，钥干，用竹刀子刮下，为细末。每用少许，时时点眼。（《圣济总录》光明散）"}]},{"ID":"20240611094707-bkhe9gv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094707-bkhe9gv","updated":"20240611094707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治小儿喉痹肿：鱼胆二七枚，（取汁）以和灶底土涂之，瘥止。（《千金方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611094707-rmcdcs3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094707-rmcdcs3","updated":"20240611094707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治阴痿：雄鸡肝一具，鲤鱼胆四枚。上二味，阴干百日，末之，雀卵和，吞小豆大一丸。（《千金方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611094707-13y5fj9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094707-13y5fj9","updated":"20240611094707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240611094707-zdo3nvx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094707-zdo3nvx","updated":"20240611094707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本草经疏》：\"凡胆皆苦寒，走厥阴，故鲤鱼胆亦主明目及目热赤痛青盲也。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611094707-hf12ac7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094707-hf12ac7","updated":"20240611094707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240611094707-n8sewn4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094707-n8sewn4","updated":"20240611094707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240611094707-igwczns","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611094707-igwczns","updated":"20240611094707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中华本草》：鲤鱼胆"}]},{"ID":"20240611094707-uatdjy6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094707-uatdjy6","updated":"20240611094707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240611094707-1ng330j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094707-1ng330j","updated":"20240611094707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Lǐ Yú Dǎn"}]},{"ID":"20240611094707-7937slc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094707-7937slc","updated":"20240611094707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240611094707-82grm6r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094707-82grm6r","updated":"20240611094707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Carp gallbladder"}]},{"ID":"20240611094707-kn2ntb6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094707-kn2ntb6","updated":"20240611094707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240611094707-65widum","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094707-65widum","updated":"20240611094707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 出自《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240611094707-5qkazoe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094707-5qkazoe","updated":"20240611094707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240611094707-zgx1w0g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094707-zgx1w0g","updated":"20240611094707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 药材基源：为鲤科动物鲤的胆囊。"}]},{"ID":"20240611094707-vh8771s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094707-vh8771s","updated":"20240611094707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：Cyprinus carpio Linnaeus."}]},{"ID":"20240611094707-cxsde9l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094707-cxsde9l","updated":"20240611094707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：将鲤鱼杀死后，取出胆囊，晾干或鲜用。"}]},{"ID":"20240611094707-r9h62k8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094707-r9h62k8","updated":"20240611094707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240611094707-ymks1ei","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094707-ymks1ei","updated":"20240611094707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生态环境：多栖息于江河、湖泊、水库、池沼的松软底层和水草丛生处。"}]},{"ID":"20240611094707-kwr71lr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094707-kwr71lr","updated":"20240611094707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：除西藏以外，各省市、自治区均有分布。"}]},{"ID":"20240611094707-zoeatc9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094707-zoeatc9","updated":"20240611094707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240611094707-fxhxddp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094707-fxhxddp","updated":"20240611094707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 鲤鱼，体呈纺锤形，侧扁，腹部圆。吻钝。口端位，呈马蹄形。须2对。眼小，位于头纵轴的上方。下咽齿3行，内侧的齿呈臼齿形。鳞大，侧线鳞33-39。鳃耙一般为18-22。背鳍3，15-21，第3硬刺坚强，后缘有锯齿。 臀鳍3，5。第3硬刺后缘也有锯齿。身体背问号 纯黑色，侧线的下方近金黄色，腹部淡白色。背、尾鳍基部微黑，雄鱼尾鳍和臀鳍橙红色。"}]},{"ID":"20240611094707-olstehg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094707-olstehg","updated":"20240611094707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240611094707-5f85ivs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094707-5f85ivs","updated":"20240611094707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 除胆汁一般常有的胆汁酸（Bileacid）、胆汁色素（Bilepigment）、脂类等外，尚含鲤甾醇（Cyprinol）；又证明在鲤体中，胆甾醇可变为鲤甾醇。还含别鹅脱氧胆酸。"}]},{"ID":"20240611094707-d0wax36","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094707-d0wax36","updated":"20240611094707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240611094707-agpi4w8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094707-agpi4w8","updated":"20240611094707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 肝；心经"}]},{"ID":"20240611094707-6t9m74g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094707-6t9m74g","updated":"20240611094707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240611094707-gsg29de","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094707-gsg29de","updated":"20240611094707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 味苦；性寒；有毒"}]},{"ID":"20240611094707-p46dkp3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094707-p46dkp3","updated":"20240611094707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240611094707-amsh7eg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094707-amsh7eg","updated":"20240611094707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 清热明目；退翳消肿；利咽。主目赤肿痛；青盲障翳；咽痛喉痹"}]},{"ID":"20240611094707-85pawl2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094707-85pawl2","updated":"20240611094707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240611094707-otrbu74","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094707-otrbu74","updated":"20240611094707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：入丸、散，1-2.5g。外用：适量，汁点、涂。"}]},{"ID":"20240611094707-3y4tp9m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094707-3y4tp9m","updated":"20240611094707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240611094707-4k0vrwb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094707-4k0vrwb","updated":"20240611094707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治眼飞血赤脉及痛：鲤鱼胆五枚，黄连（去须，捣为未）半两。上二味，取胆汁调黄连未，纳瓷合盛，于饭上蒸一次，取出，如干，即人少许蜜，调似膏。日五、七度，涂敷目眦。（《圣济总录》鱼胆敷眼膏）②治眼睛上生晕，不问久新：鲤鱼一头，长一尺二勺者，取胆用，刺破，滴汁在铜照上，阴干，用竹刀子刮下，为细未。每用少许，时时点眼。（《圣济总录》光明散）③治小儿喉痹肿：鱼胆二七枚，（取汁）以和灶底土涂之，搓止。（《千金方》）④治阴痿：雄鸡肝一具，鲤鱼胆四枚。上二味，阴千百日，未之，雀卵和，吞小豆大一丸。（《千金方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611094707-9iaswsx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094707-9iaswsx","updated":"20240611094707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240611094707-b705ppj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094707-b705ppj","updated":"20240611094707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.《本草经疏》：凡胆皆苦寒，走厥阴，故鲤鱼胆亦主明目及口热赤痛青盲也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611094707-txx7oz2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094707-txx7oz2","updated":"20240611094707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《本经》：主目热赤痛，青盲，明目。"}]},{"ID":"20240611094707-dc4an0u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094707-dc4an0u","updated":"20240611094707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《肘后方》：点雀日燥痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240611094707-d8qq8qj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094707-d8qq8qj","updated":"20240611094707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《药性论》：点眼，治亦肿翳痛；小儿热肿涂之。"}]},{"ID":"20240611094707-rbi9bx4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094707-rbi9bx4","updated":"20240611094707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《本草拾遗》：主耳聋，滴耳中。"}]},{"ID":"20240611094707-rumfx66","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094707-rumfx66","updated":"20240611094707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.《陆川本草》：清肝，明目，治白喉。"}]},{"ID":"20240611094707-a39ujmg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094707-a39ujmg","updated":"20240611094707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240611094707-omfdrt9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094707-omfdrt9","updated":"20240611094707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240611094709-i7lw794","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611094709-i7lw794"}},{"ID":"20240611094709-vrhg9js","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611094709-vrhg9js"}}]}